  {:cite/id "rues-nit-900102580-is-alicorp-colombia"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "Colombia's RUES, asked for NIT 900102580, returns ALICORP COLOMBIA S.A.S. The NIT GLEIF recorded on the child LEI resolves in Colombia's own commercial register to the same company. Asked for 900102581 the same endpoint answers HTTP 200 with an empty array, so this row is carried by the body and not by the status."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "ALICORP COLOMBIA S.A.S"}

  {:cite/id "rues-chamber-is-bogota"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "RUES records that company's chamber of commerce as BOGOTA -- independently confirming RA000101, the registration authority GLEIF names on the child LEI. This is the single strongest non-GLEIF claim in this catalog."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"camara_comercio\":\"BOGOTA\""}

  {:cite/id "rues-check-digit"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "RUES gives the NIT's check digit as 3, completing 900102580-3 -- the exact string GLEIF stores in registeredAs. The two registers agree down to the check digit."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"digito_verificacion\":\"3\""}

  {:cite/id "rues-matricula"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "RUES gives the company a mercantile registration number of 1628581, a Colombian identifier that appears in no GLEIF field."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"matricula\":\"1628581\""}

  {:cite/id "rues-status-activa"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "The registration status is ACTIVA. This matters because RUES also holds two CANCELADA companies named ALICORP S A S and GRUPO ALICORP - ALPHA SAS, and a live but unrelated ALIANZA CORPORATIVA ALICORP SAS in Villavicencio -- searching RUES by name would return all four. The NIT is what disambiguates, which is why this row queries by NIT and not by name."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"estado_matricula\":\"ACTIVA\""}

  {:cite/id "rues-registered-2006"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "RUES dates the Colombian registration to 2006-08-25, seven years before the parent's LEI was issued. Only the commercial register carries that date."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/resource/c82u-588k.json?nit=900102580"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"fecha_matricula\":\"20060825\""}

  {:cite/id "rues-dataset-is-the-national-register"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "The dataset queried above is described by its publisher as the Registro Unico Empresarial y Social (RUES) -- so the rows are the national register itself, not a third-party scrape of it. This body is UTF-8, unlike GLEIF's escaped output, so the accented form matches verbatim here."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/api/views/c82u-588k.json"
   :cite/expect-substring "Registro Único Empresarial y Social"}

  {:cite/id "rues-dataset-source-chambers"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "Its description states the data comes from the Registro Mercantil administered by the chambers of commerce nationally -- which is the same book GLEIF's RA000101 entry describes, reached from the Colombian side."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/api/views/c82u-588k.json"
   :cite/expect-substring "Registro Mercantil que administran las C"}

  {:cite/id "rues-dataset-attribution-link"
   :cite/authority :co-rues
   :cite/claim "The dataset's attribution link is rues.org.co, the register's own site, published on Colombia's national open-data portal."
   :cite/url "https://www.datos.gov.co/api/views/c82u-588k.json"
   :cite/expect-substring "rues.org.co"}

  {:cite/id "sri-ruc-is-inbalnor"
   :cite/authority :ec-sri
   :cite/claim "Ecuador's SRI, asked for RUC 0992711523001, returns INBALNOR S.A. The RUC GLEIF recorded on the Ecuadorian child resolves at Ecuador's tax authority to the same institution. Asked for a one-digit-off RUC the same endpoint answers HTTP 204, and asked for an unrelated valid RUC it answers 200 with a different company -- so again the substring, not the status, carries this row."
   :cite/url "https://srienlinea.sri.gob.ec/sri-catastro-sujeto-servicio-internet/rest/ConsolidadoContribuyente/obtenerPorNumerosRuc?ruc=0992711523001"
   :cite/expect-substring "INBALNOR S.A."}

  {:cite/id "sri-status-activo"
   :cite/authority :ec-sri
   :cite/claim "The SRI records that taxpayer as ACTIVO -- the Ecuadorian subsidiary GLEIF still lists as a child is still a live taxpayer, checked against the tax register rather than against the LEI record's own renewal date. The substring spans the name and the status together, so pointing this row at another live company cannot leave it standing (see IDENTITY ROWS above)."
   :cite/url "https://srienlinea.sri.gob.ec/sri-catastro-sujeto-servicio-internet/rest/ConsolidadoContribuyente/obtenerPorNumerosRuc?ruc=0992711523001"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"razonSocial\":\"INBALNOR S.A.\",\"estadoContribuyenteRuc\":\"ACTIVO\""}

  {:cite/id "sri-activity-aquafeed"
   :cite/authority :ec-sri
   :cite/claim "The SRI gives the principal economic activity as manufacture of prepared feeds for aquatic animals. That is the aquafeed line Alicorp runs through its Vitapro subsidiaries, which GLEIF also lists as children of this LEI -- so the corporate edge and the business activity corroborate each other from two unrelated sources."
   :cite/url "https://srienlinea.sri.gob.ec/sri-catastro-sujeto-servicio-internet/rest/ConsolidadoContribuyente/obtenerPorNumerosRuc?ruc=0992711523001"
   :cite/expect-substring "ALIMENTOS PREPARADOS PARA ANIMALES"}

  {:cite/id "sri-inicio-actividades"
   :cite/authority :ec-sri
   :cite/claim "The SRI dates the start of activities to 2011-03-22, an Ecuadorian fact that appears in no GLEIF field."
   :cite/url "https://srienlinea.sri.gob.ec/sri-catastro-sujeto-servicio-internet/rest/ConsolidadoContribuyente/obtenerPorNumerosRuc?ruc=0992711523001"
   :cite/expect-substring "2011-03-22"}

  {:cite/id "sri-ruc-binds-name"
   :cite/authority :ec-sri
   :cite/claim "In the SRI's record the RUC and the legal name are adjacent fields, so a single substring binds identifier to name. This is the row that makes the Ecuadorian join unfalsifiable by coincidence: no other taxpayer can satisfy it, whatever else it shares with this one."
   :cite/url "https://srienlinea.sri.gob.ec/sri-catastro-sujeto-servicio-internet/rest/ConsolidadoContribuyente/obtenerPorNumerosRuc?ruc=0992711523001"
   :cite/expect-substring "\"numeroRuc\":\"0992711523001\",\"razonSocial\":\"INBALNOR S.A.\""}]}
